{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"a4e35e8e-35ff-4609-8c41-7e51b75ab10b","step":{"id":"s1","script":"We want the area under y equals x squared from zero to two. Rectangles give an approximation we can calculate.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Area from rectangles"},{"op":"figure","id":"graph","region":"right","frame":{"x":[0,2.2],"y":[0,4.5],"axes":"edge","x_label":"x","y_label":"y"},"marks":[{"kind":"fn","id":"curve","y":"x^2","domain":[0,2],"label":"y = x²"},{"kind":"segment","from":[2,0],"to":{"on":"curve","x":2},"stroke":"dashed"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"target","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"A=\\int_0^2 x^2\\,dx"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"a4e35e8e-35ff-4609-8c41-7e51b75ab10b","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Split the interval into four equal widths. Use each left endpoint for height; the first rectangle has zero height.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"rectangles","on":"graph","marks":[{"kind":"segment","from":[0,0],"to":[0.5,0]},{"kind":"polyline","points":[[0.5,0],[1,0],[1,0.25],[0.5,0.25]],"closed":true,"fill":true},{"kind":"polyline","points":[[1,0],[1.5,0],[1.5,1],[1,1]],"closed":true,"fill":true},{"kind":"polyline","points":[[1.5,0],[2,0],[2,2.25],[1.5,2.25]],"closed":true,"fill":true},{"kind":"point","at":{"on":"curve","x":0.5}},{"kind":"point","at":{"on":"curve","x":1}},{"kind":"point","at":{"on":"curve","x":1.5}}]},{"op":"equation","id":"width","anchor":{"el":"target","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"\\Delta x=\\frac{2-0}{4}=\\frac12"},{"op":"equation","id":"sum","anchor":{"el":"width","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"L_4=\\frac12\\left(0^2+0.5^2+1^2+1.5^2\\right)=1.75"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.warning","request_id":"a4e35e8e-35ff-4609-8c41-7e51b75ab10b","code":"step_repaired","step_hint":"s3"}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"a4e35e8e-35ff-4609-8c41-7e51b75ab10b","step":{"id":"s3","script":"The curve rises, so left rectangles miss area. As widths shrink toward zero, the sums approach the exact area, eight thirds.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"gaps","on":"graph","marks":[{"kind":"segment","from":[0.75,0.25],"to":{"on":"curve","x":0.75},"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"segment","from":[1.25,1],"to":{"on":"curve","x":1.25},"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"segment","from":[1.75,2.25],"to":{"on":"curve","x":1.75},"stroke":"dashed"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"limit","anchor":{"el":"sum","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"L_4<A=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\sum_{i=0}^{n-1}\\left(\\frac{2i}{n}\\right)^2\\frac{2}{n}=\\frac83"}],"checkpoint":null}}
